'''The Battle Cats POP!''' is a strategy, tower defense game developed and published by PONOS for Nintendo 3DS. A special launch event with [[The Battle Cats]] started on June 27th, 2016.

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Unite!'''}} for Nintendo Switch teams up with the Battle Cats mobile app for a {{Color|#9900FF|'''First anniversary collab'''}}!

Visit the Event Stages/Legend Stages and select the special map {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Together!'''}} to take on this challenge!<br>
Celebrate the release of {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Unite! on Nintendo Switch'''}}, with {{Color|#9900FF|'''special collab stages'''}} available in the mobile version of The Battle Cats!

Visit the Event Stages/Legend Stages and select the special map {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats Together!'''}} to take on this challenge!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from June 30, 2025 (11:00AM) until July 14, 2025 (10:59AM)!'''}}

Clearing each stage in The Battle Cats Together! map for a small chance to acquire the unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Bros'''}}! Your chance of earning this drop reward increases in later stages!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''get Timed Score drop rewards based on your score after clearing each stage!'''}}

Earn XP and useful items by getting high scores on each stage!

※ Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% guarantee to collect the Cat Bros unit.<br>
※ Activate your new unit at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after receiving it.

Visit The Battle Cats Unite! for Nintendo Switch website for more info (only accessible in certain countries)!

