{{Color|#E97132|'''●Collab stages from The Battle Cats POP! on 3DS available!'''}}<br>
Visit Event Stages/Legend Stages and select the special maps {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats POP!'''}} and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Kart Awakens!'''}} to take on this challenge!

By clearing each stage in The Battle Cats POP! map, there is a small chance to acquire the unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Kart R!'''}} The chance to earn it increases in the later stages!

Clearing each stage of the Cat Kart Awakens! map will {{Color|#FF0000|'''unlock the True Form of Cat Kart R!'''}} Your chance of earning this drop reward increases in later stages!

Also, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''get Timed Score drop rewards based on your score after clearing each stage'''}}!<br>
Earn XP and useful items by getting high scores on each stage!

※ Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% guarantee to collect the Cat Kart R unit.<br>
※ Activate your new unit at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after receiving it.<br>
※Cat Kart R must be at Lv. 20 in order to evolve into its True Form.<br>
※Cat Kart R's True Form can be obtained even if the unit has not been unlocked.<br>
※Cat Kart R cannot be earned again if it has been unlocked in a previous collab event.

