==Trivia==
*Stages 1-5 talk about the features of the game (Including no in-app-purchases, PvP, etc.), while stages 6-8 talk about the game in general (Getting an Uber Rare, Conquering the world). Most of this stage names resemble the phrases that popped up in [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O_2MwkB0K-s The Battle Cats POP! Official Trailer].

